---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="History of the Epsilon Mu Chapter of Eta Kappa Nu at UTA.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About Us</h1>

    <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center">
      <img src="/images/hkn-fall2017.jpg" alt="UTA HKN chapter members" class="max-h-96 rounded-lg object-cover shadow-sm" />
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-8 max-w-none">
      <p>
        Eta Kappa Nu (HKN) is the international honor society of IEEE, recognizing excellence
        among students and professionals in electrical engineering, computer engineering, and
        related fields. The <strong>Epsilon Mu Chapter</strong> at The University of Texas at
        Arlington was established in <strong>1965</strong> and is based in Nedderman Hall, Room 132.
      </p>
      <p class="rounded-md border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-amber-900">
        TODO: Replace this section with the chapter's real history, mission statement, and any
        notable milestones or awards. This paragraph is placeholder content from the site rebuild.
      </p>
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Recognize academically outstanding EE/CE students through induction</li>
        <li>Provide free peer tutoring and exam review sessions</li>
        <li>Host professional development and social events for members</li>
        <li>Connect students with the broader IEEE-HKN alumni network</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
